arm64-darwin  cxx1 emits `__Unwind_Resume` and clang does not, on this target only: a guarded temporary in an arm gets a landing pad here, and clang emits no cleanup for it on Mach-O - the difference temporary-in-short-circuit.nonames records for the operand `&&` may skip. x86_64-linux and x86_64-windows agree name for name.
